**Note on source quality.** The paper prioritizes peer-reviewed journal and conference literature for foundational claims and clearly identifies recent arXiv/preprint work where the rapidly developing autonomous-science literature has not yet accumulated equivalent peer-reviewed coverage. Bibliographic details and persistent identifiers were checked against scholarly or publisher/index records where available. The 2026 literature is included primarily to characterize the current research frontier rather than to substitute for established foundational work.
